{
  "description": "OAuth grants. Response members are narrowed to what Resend returns: required where resend-node, the maintained official SDK, declares them non-optional and every live response (2026-10-29) carried them, and nullable where resend-node allows null or a live response held null. The grant items follow resend-node alone, without a live check: a grant needs an authorized OAuth app, which the test team doesn't have. Errors on these operations match Resend's error `name` and status; the classes shared with other areas are in shared.json.",
